## Citation Conventions

A citation number is REQUIRED to cite any reference!
Legal citing syntax examples (separated by |): [[1]]|[[1,2]]|[[1-3]]|[[12,13-15]]|[[1-3,5-7]]
Illegal citing syntax examples (separated by |): [[1],[2],[3]]|[[1],[1-2]]
You SHALL not cite a single reference more than once! It's recommended to cite multiple references that supports your conclusion at a time.
